# The only image built from the repository root is the documentation site's
# (deploy/site/Dockerfile). Everything is excluded, then the three things it
# COPYs are let back in, so a `.venv`, a bench corpus or a stray log never
# enters a build context or an image layer.
*
!deploy/site/wheelhouse/
!apps/site/siteapp/
!dist/site/
**/__pycache__/
